# Carbuncle Debacle (battlefield.carbuncle_debacle_cloister_of_gales, CloisterOfGales): the exit. The char enters arena
# 1, then Wind_Protocrystal (arena 1's), in the battlefield: 32003 (an optional cutscene, skippable); its update:
# nothing; finished with 0: not 4: still inside. Again, finished with 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (no win, no loss event).
# Then WP_Entrance, no trade: the clearance is kept (effect 254, power 417), so the override's non-registrant arm
# (isValidEntry) passes: the menu 32000 again.
lists CloisterOfGales/WP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfGales/WP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfGales/Wind_Protocrystal/onTrigger CloisterOfGales/onEventUpdate/32003 CloisterOfGales/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.CarbuncleDebacle accepted
charvar CarbuncleDebacleProgress 6
item WindPendulum
login
trade WP_Entrance WindPendulum x1      # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=17                  # index 1, area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Wind_Protocrystal                  # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Wind_Protocrystal                  # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
warp -357.6,-0.1,-380.0 CloisterOfGales
trigger WP_Entrance                     # the clearance kept: the helper arm: the menu 32000 again
